OL,3,GNEWSAPrison still has long way to go,
OL,4,Ainspector says
OL,5,
OL,6,FHM chief inspector of prisons has said
OL,7,Fthere is still a "long way to go"
OL,8,Fbefore an institution can be described
OL,9,Fas safe and decent, despite the "good
OL,10,Fprogress" that has been made.
OL,12,FIn his latest report, Charlie Taylor
OL,13,Fdescribed a catalogue of problems at
OL,14,FHMP Bedford including concerns about
OL,15,Flevels of violence, drug use and living
OL,16,Fconditions.
OL,18,FTaylor said the category B prison had a
OL,19,F"troubled recent history" and in 2023
OL,20,Fhe called for it to be put into
OL,21,Femergency measures.
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
